scenario.en:
async createOrder(dto: CreateOrderDto) {
  const order = await this.orders.save(dto);   // line 1: commits to Postgres
  // <-- pod receives SIGTERM here, process exits
  this.client.emit('order.created', order);    // line 2: NEVER RUNS
}

No try/catch, no outbox. After the pod dies between line 1 and line 2: what is in the order DB, what reached the broker, and what does inventory know?

